SCOPE NOTE (read before relying on this file)
==============================================

The MIT License below covers ONLY the software in this repository — the code
and scripts (everything under `scripts/`, `mcp_server/`, and `tests/`, plus
build and tooling configuration). It does NOT license the DATA corpus under
`krr_outputs/` (and other generated JSON-LD artifacts).

Roughly 99% of the data is verbatim or lightly transformed third-party legal
material (Riigi Teataja statutes and regulations, EUR-Lex EU acts, RIK /
Riigikohus and EU Court of Justice decisions). MIT is a software licence and
cannot grant rights over those third-party texts, nor over the EU sui generis
database right. The data is governed by a separate, layered rights model — see
the top-level `NOTICE` file and `docs/DATA_RIGHTS.md`. Some material also
contains personal data; see `docs/DATA_PROTECTION.md` before republishing.

The text below is the standard MIT License and applies to the code/scripts only.

